# WS3-10. Sources: spec/04 §10 and spec/06 (function values are exact-signature C
# function pointers; a capture-less lambda matches func(...); a capturing closure
# fills a generic callable-bound parameter, spec/06 §6.1). twice(+3, 1) = 7,
# twice(*10, 2) = 200, apply(+3, 4) = 7, apply(+k, 5) = 7.
profiles: host hosted-amiga hosted-amiga-13
expect: output
contrast: twice(g, 1) ==> twice(g, 2)
contrast-expect: output
--- output
7 200 7 7
--- contrast-output
8 200 7 7
